Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors no third-party source. It depends on flaime-serving
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/IndigiGenius/flaime-serving), which contains a
standalone reimplementation of the XEUS encoder architecture written against
ESPnet's XEUS SSL model; see that repository's NOTICE for the attribution.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test fixture data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

tests/fixtures/community_eval/audio/ contains 8 short excerpts from the
LibriSpeech test-clean corpus, licensed CC BY 4.0:

  V. Panayotov, G. Chen, D. Povey and S. Khudanpur, "Librispeech: An ASR
  corpus based on public domain audiobooks," 2015 IEEE International
  Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP), 2015,
  pp. 5206-5210. https://www.openslr.org/12/

No modification beyond resampling to 16kHz mono PCM. See
tests/fixtures/community_eval/manifest.yaml for the per-utterance source IDs
and tests/fixtures/community_eval/fetch_librispeech_samples.sh to regenerate.

