Model weights are not covered by this license
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apache-2.0 license in LICENSE covers the source code in this repository.
It does NOT cover any model checkpoint the demo loads. No weights are committed
here — they live outside the repo under the CHECKPOINTS_DIR contract described
in README.md — and each checkpoint carries the license of the foundation model
it derives from. Two of the three supported families are non-commercial. See
"Licensing" in README.md.
